 write buffer | 4 | same | skipped 35 units 26 rows 6410 | kept order skips the same
 write buffer | 5 | same | skipped 1 units 61 rows 15370 | kept order skips the same
 write buffer | 6 | same | skipped 55 units 6 rows 1290 | kept order skips the same
(6 rows)

